  "result": "Perfect! All 459 tests pass (435 + 24 new bulk discount tests).\n\n## Summary\n\n**Bulk Discount Implementation:**\n\n**src/totals.js** - Updated `lineDiscount()`:\n- Lines with qty \u2265 10 now get an extra 2.5% discount\n- Applied AFTER the primary discount (line's discountPercent or tier discount)\n- Calculated as 2.5% of the amount remaining after primary discount\n- invoiceTotals counts both discounts in the `discount` field\n- VAT is calculated on the amount after both discounts are applied\n\n**Example calculation:**\n- Line: qty=10, unitPrice=1000, discountPercent=10, vatRate=21\n- Subtotal: 10,000\n- Primary discount: 1,000\n- Amount after primary: 9,000\n- Bulk discount (2.5% of 9,000): 225\n- Total discount: 1,225\n- Amount for VAT: 8,775\n- VAT (21%): 1,843\n- Total with VAT: 10,000 - 1,225 + 1,843 = 10,618\n\n**test/totals.test.js** - Added 24 comprehensive tests:\n- Bulk discount threshold: exactly 10 units qualifies, 9 units doesn't\n- Discount stacking: bulk applied after primary, not instead of\n- VAT calculation: correctly on post-discount amount\n- invoiceTotals: bulk discount included in totals\n- Edge cases: 100% primary discount, large quantities, fractional prices\n- Interaction: with tier discounts, vouchers, multiple lines",
